## 2. 最终正向验收（实际命令与退出码）

```text
make -C micro user initrd                        EXIT=0
make -C micro BOOT_MODULES=capability            EXIT=0
./micro/tools/demo.sh                            EXIT=0
```

`/tmp/m7-postdocs-positive.log`（最终代码）关键行：

```text
[demo] build kernel + user + initrd + fs-image
[demo] expected motd sha256=74bf28d9c7030ae2deecf3cd87c9ba7580a5cc4b152070d3b1492671bc526e18
[demo] shell prompt ok
[demo] help ok
[demo] cat motd ok (sha256=74bf28d9c7030ae2deecf3cd87c9ba7580a5cc4b152070d3b1492671bc526e18)
[demo] ps ok
[demo] echo ok
[demo] poweroff ok
[demo] PASS
```

串口侧同时有：

```text
[init] shell ready
micro> help
commands: help cat ps echo poweroff
[shell] cat /motd
microkernel motd v1
[shell] ps
pid=... init
pid=... sm
pid=... pm
pid=... fs
pid=... console
pid=... shell
[kmain] shutdown requested by shell
```

demo 只在收到 `[kmain] shutdown requested by shell` 后接受关机，并等待 QEMU 退出。

## 3. 判别性负向验收（证明断言不是无条件 PASS）

```text
./micro/tools/demo.sh --expect-nonzero          EXIT=1
```

最终脚本的 `--expect-nonzero` 等价于 `--cat-path /nonexistent`。关键行：

```text
[demo] cat FAIL (sha256 mismatch actual=355a204c638a01cb454dcca911172c50f85e27cab9d824af515a0edc300b087a expected=74bf28d9c7030ae2deecf3cd87c9ba7580a5cc4b152070d3b1492671bc526e18)
[demo] FAIL
```

对应 QEMU 串口（`.artifacts/demo-20261125-001543.log`，去 NUL 后）：

```text
micro> cat /nonexistent
----- cat /nonexistent -----
cat: /nonexistent: not found
----- end cat -----
```

即 shell 明确收到 `TAG_FS_NOT_FOUND` 并打印 not found；demo 仍按 `/motd` 哈希断言，
因此该负向模式必然 FAIL 并 exit 1。启动期 `[fs] ENOENT` 来自 `/largefile` 探测，
不是本负向路径的判定依据。

